<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Import Data Pegawai - e-Kinerja HC</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/output.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50">
  <%- include('../partials/sidebar') %>
  <%- include('../partials/topbar', { pageTitle: 'Import Data Pegawai' }) %>

  <main class="ml-64 pt-16 p-6">
    <a href="/pegawai" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-gray-500 hover:text-brand-blue mb-4">
      <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7" />
      </svg>
      Kembali
    </a>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-6 max-w-xl">
      <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-800 mb-1">Import Data Pegawai</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-5">Upload file Excel (.xlsx) atau CSV berisi data pegawai</p>

      <% if (errorMsg && errorMsg.length > 0) { %>
        <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 text-red-700 text-sm px-4 py-3 rounded-lg mb-4"><%= errorMsg %></div>
      <% } %>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 text-blue-700 text-xs px-4 py-3 rounded-lg mb-5">
        <p class="font-semibold mb-1">Ketentuan Import:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-0.5">
          <li>Kolom <strong>NIP</strong> dan <strong>Nama</strong> wajib ada di tiap baris</li>
          <li>Huruf besar/kecil pada nama kolom tidak masalah</li>
          <li>Kolom yang tidak dikenali sistem akan otomatis diabaikan</li>
          <li>Kalau NIP sudah ada, datanya akan diperbarui otomatis</li>
          <li>Kolom yang cocok field bawaan (NIP, Nama, Jabatan, Golongan, dll) atau field tambahan yang sudah dibuat akan otomatis terisi</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <form action="/pegawai/import" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="space-y-4">
        <div>
          <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-600 mb-1.5">Pilih File</label>
          <input type="file" name="file_import" accept=".xlsx,.xls,.csv" required
            class="w-full border border-gray-200 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-blue">
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-3 pt-2">
          <a href="/pegawai" class="flex-1 text-center border border-gray-200 text-gray-600 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-gray-50">Batal</a>
          <button type="submit" class="flex-1 bg-brand-blue text-white font-semibold py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm shadow-sm hover:opacity-90">Import Sekarang</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>